    summary: ["Your site can't be one of the types CDS never hosts, and some types are reviewed before CDS accepts them.","CDS can take your site down at once for illegal content, and gives you 3 days to fix other breaches.","You are responsible for everything you and your customers publish on your site."],
    changes: null,
